# Veetee Terminal 10x10 — an original bitmap typeface in the style of
# 1980s DEC video terminals. Drawn on a 10x10 dot cell: columns 1-7 carry
# the glyph (dot stretching adds half a dot to the right), rows 1-7 are
# cap height, rows 8-9 descenders. Box drawing meets at column 4, row 4.
#
# Copyright 2026 The veetee Authors. Licensed under the SIL Open Font
# License, Version 1.1 (see OFL.txt).
#
# Format: "cell W H", then for each glyph a "U+XXXX" line followed by H
# rows of W characters, "#" for a lit dot and "." for dark.

